{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04956","headline":"奉和立春游苑迎春应制 · 马怀素","name":"奉和立春游苑迎春应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄龠飞灰出洞房，青郊迎气肇初阳。\n仙舆暂下宜春苑，御醴行开荐寿觞。\n映水轻苔犹隐绿，缘堤弱柳未舒黄。\n唯有裁花饰簪鬓，恒随圣藻狎年光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马怀素","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04956.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04956","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}